$EEA4 ; trigger box: x 160, row $54, 4 x 4 cells, set off by Rick, every pass
$EEA8 ; kind $16: detonators pickup; row $55, column 21, y +3 px; spawns in view, one-shot, 1 box
$EEAC ; trigger box: x 168, row $55, 3 x 3 cells, set off by Rick
