$EED0 ; kind $22: trap, behaviour $10; row $71, column 26; spawns on its box, 1 box
$EED4 ; trigger box: x 224, row $7A, 1 x 2 cells, set off by punch
$EED8 ; kind $22: trap, behaviour $10; row $75, column 10; spawns on its box, 1 box
$EEDC ; trigger box: x 32, row $74, 2 x 4 cells, set off by Rick, every pass
$EEE0 ; kind $14: treasure pickup; row $75, column 4, y +3 px; spawns in view, one-shot, 1 box
$EEE4 ; trigger box: x 32, row $75, 3 x 3 cells, set off by Rick
$EEE8 ; kind $7B: enemy wanders and climbs after Rick (sprite set 0), patrol 8 px; row $79, column 25; spawns in view
$EEEC ; kind $2F: trap, behaviour $10; row $79, column 25, y +3 px; spawns on its box, one-shot, 1 box
$EEF0 ; trigger box: x 160, row $7E, 4 x 2 cells, set off by Rick
$EEF4 ; kind $0A: trap, behaviour $24; row $80, column 8; spawns in view, 1 box
